1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
What exactly is a spurious feature? Think about it.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A photographer travels to the Arctic.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The penguin is the cause, and the snowy background is the effect.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The causal arrow points from the label to the background.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
But the AI reads this arrow in reverse.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
It sees the background and infers the penguin. This is anti-causal prediction.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
When the environment shifts, this shortcut shatters. Causal features are stable.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Spurious features are brittle.
